[32;1m[1;3mQuestion: A large industrial factory plans monthly production for 111 products, P1 through P111. Producing each product requires processing time on 10 heavy machinery devices, A through J. The unit profit of each product is provided in unit_product_profits.csv, the processing time required by each product on each device is provided in device_time.csv, and the total monthly operating capacity of each device is provided in monthly_device_capacity.csv. Determine the nonnegative continuous production quantity of each product that maximizes total monthly profit while ensuring that the total processing time used on each device does not exceed that device's monthly capacity.
